[size=5][b][color=#E8C88A]Wilder Wildlife 1.0[/color][/b][/size]

Turn familiar boar herds and wolf packs into encounters of your choosing!

[list]
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Choose your enemies:[/color][/b] Bandits, Regular guards, Blood guards, Vidmo or Kobolds, with one shared selection for boars and wolves.
[*][b][color=#A8D5C2]Choose their numbers:[/color][/b] Set a minimum and maximum from 1 to 10. Try 2–4 Blood guards, 4–10 Kobolds, or 1–1 for a single enemy.
[/list]

[size=4][b][color=#E8C88A]How to use it[/color][/b][/size]

Open [b]Mod Settings > Wilder Wildlife - Customize Enemy Spawns[/b].

[list]
[*]Under [b]Wildlife[/b], leave Boars or Wolves [b]Off[/b] to adjust wildlife group size. Turn them [b]On[/b] to show the replacement chance instead.
[*]Under [b]Enemy type[/b], enable the enemies you want. Their size sliders appear directly underneath.
[*]Press [b]Apply[/b]. New groups and later natural respawns use your choices; existing groups keep theirs.
[/list]

Set both size limits to the same number for a fixed group size. [b]No spawn[/b] is also available for an empty encounter.

[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/thebloodofdawnwalker/mods/711]Download Wilder Wildlife[/url]
